* Mistwalker can also be upgraded at the [[Forge of Potential]] with a [[Black Marble Battle Idol]].

== Notes ==
* The blade of the Mistwalker is constantly enshrouded in mist and also glows faintly bluish-white at all times. It is a bit dimmer than most proper light sources, but can provide some light in the dark.
** The glow effect also makes players slightly easier to detect while [[Sneak_(Skill)|sneaking]], increasing the visibility of its holder by approximately 20%.
* Before [[1.0]], the Mistwalker was the only weapon to have mist repulsion at a 5 meter range. Other recipes have not been updated and Mistwalker remains the only weapon which requires Wisp to be crafted.

